<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="S2.T2.3" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>. </span><span id="S2.T2.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Comprehensive Messaging Framework Comparison Under Standardized Conditions</span></figcaption>
