<section id="S4.SS3" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">4.3. </span>Machine Learning Components and Integration Architecture</h3>

<div id="S4.SS3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">The AIEO system employs multiple specialized machine learning components that work collaboratively to provide comprehensive intelligent orchestration capabilities. Table <a href="#S4.T7" title="Table 7 ‣ 4.3. Machine Learning Components and Integration Architecture ‣ 4. AI-Enhanced Event Orchestration Architecture ‣ Next-Generation Event-Driven Architectures: Performance, Scalability, and Intelligent Orchestration Across Messaging Frameworks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">7</span></a> details the complete architecture including algorithms, input features, prediction targets, and integration mechanisms for each component within the orchestration framework.</p>
</div>
